Follow up on the Exp issue that was brought up here.<P>you need about 41,000,000 (That's million) exp to get out of 54.<P>You need 38 Million to get a character from level 1 to level 35.<P><BR>*MY* definition of a hell level is one that takes more experience to get out of than the next level.  (I know this is not the common usage.)<P>In which case the next hell level after 50 would be 59.<P>Level 59 takes 80 million exp to break and 60 only takes 48 million to complete.  <P>Also Level 54 is the half way point to level 60.  Exp needed to *reach* level 54 is 227 million and Exp needed to reach 60 is 554 million.  OUCH!<P>These numbers were based on a human.  They change slightly between races and classes however you should get the point.  (The half way point for a Wood Elf Druid is lvl 55.  We need 616 million exp to reach level 60.
